{{#> layout
  title='Online Dictionary for English, German, French, and other languages'
  url='/search.html'
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-2 mb-lg-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  ogImage="search.png"
  noCta=true
  hidePricing=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
}}
  <div class="container-md pb-5 pt-1 pt-md-5">
    <div id="search"></div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9f9f9;">
    <div class="container-md py-5" style="font-size: 80%">
      <h2 class="h5" style="color: var(--bs-body-color); font-size: 140%">A <span class="language-replacer prepend">dictionary</span> for language learners</h2>
      <div class="mb-2">
        To understand everyday <span class="language-replacer replace">language</span>, you need to know about <a class="link-secondary" href="https://openaccess.wgtn.ac.nz/articles/journal_contribution/How_large_a_vocabulary_is_needed_for_reading_and_listening_/12552221/1?file=23375270" target="_blank">6,000–9,000 words</a>. Do you see a new <span class="language-replacer prepend">word</span>? Or do you not know the right word to use? Look it up in Vocably's dictionary. You get a clear translation and real examples. Then save the word and practise it until you remember it.
      </div>
      <div class="mb-2">
        General-purpose dictionaries are written for reference. Vocably is designed for language learning, so every word you look up can become a word you actually know.
      </div>
      <div class="mb-5"><strong>New Discord group</strong>: if you find a problem with any dictionary entry, join the <a href="https://discord.gg/9aRwbJ3qeh" class="link-secondary" style="white-space: nowrap;" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-discord" style="margin-right: 4px; font-size: 90%;"></i>Discord group</a> and report it so it can be fixed.</div>
      <div class="mb-4 text-left">
        {{> tiny-cta }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="modal fade" id="myModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="myModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
      <div class="modal-content p-3">
        <div class="modal-header border-0">
          <h5 class="modal-title" style="line-height: 1.2em;" id="myModalLabel">Learn this word in the mobile app.</h5>
          <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close" style="    align-self: flex-start;
           margin-top: 0.02rem;
          "></button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body pt-0">
          <p class="fw-lighter fst-italic" style="font-size: 80%">
            Currently, the Vocably experience is available only via the mobile app or browser extension. The web version will be available soon. <a href="/about.html" class="link-secondary">I am working on it</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Vocably is a smart dictionary that saves your look-ups and translations and helps you learn them. To start learning, set up the mobile app:
          </p>
          <ol class="mb-4 ps-3">
            <li class="mb-2">Install the Vocably app on your phone.</li>
            <li class="mb-2">Translate any word or phrase using the app, then learn it with interactive tests and quizzes.</li>
          </ol>
          <style>
            .install-ways {
              display: inline-grid;
              grid-template-columns: max-content max-content;
              gap: 10px;
            }
          </style>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="install-ways">
              <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/vocably-pro-language-cards/id1641258757" target="_blank" class="d-inline-block" data-umami-event="Search Learn Modal Click" data-umami-event-label="iOS"><img src="assets/download-on-app-store.svg" alt="Download on App Store" height="40" /></a>
              <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vocablypro" target="_blank" class="d-inline-block ms-2" data-umami-event="Search Learn Modal Click" data-umami-event-label="Android"><img src="assets/get-it-on-google-play.svg" alt="Get it on Google Play" height="40" /></a>
              <style>
                .scan-to-install {
                  /*--fill: #fff;*/
                  width: 100%;
                  padding: 16px;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  border-radius: 8px;
                  display: inline-flex;
                  gap: 16px;
                  flex-direction: column;
                }
              </style>
              <div class="scan-to-install hide-ios hide-android" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
                <div>
                  or scan the QR code to install
                </div>
                <vocably-qr-code aria-label="QR Code"></vocably-qr-code>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-3 text-center">
            <a href="/" class="link-secondary">Learn more about Vocably.</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}

